Install the required packages by running the following command in your terminal:
```
npm install discord.js @discordjs/slash-command
```
The `discord.js` package will handle interacting with the Discord API and executing slash commands. The `@discordjs/slash-command` package will allow us to use a more convenient syntax when defining our slash commands.

